                    </Text>
                    <Text style={{
                        fontSize: 15, color: '#6B5B4B', lineHeight: 1.55,
                    }}>
                        团队 UPT 仅
                        <span style={{ color: '#D65A3F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}> 1.33 </span>
